WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:10.010
Wonder is defined as the vitality and appreciation
felt when one experiences something new and

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.910
transcending.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:16.430
Something rich with revelation, progress,
and beauty.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:22.560
Something that seems to causes time to cease
and life to absorb into your being, where

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.310
everything becomes clear and peaceful.

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:30.090
Life is synonymous with progression.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:34.230
It is constantly accelerating towards something.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:40.160
We do not know what, or even why, but we do
know that we are a part of it.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.820
And all we want is to feel connected to it.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:51.460
Just as we hate to be left out of social activities
with friends and family, we would hate even

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:57.130
more to be left out of the activity of life
itself.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:04.480
As members of nature’s evolution, the most
enthralling and worthy pursuit is to experience

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:09.190
that which synchronizes us with its movement.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:14.100
To experience something unfamiliar and advancing.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:21.060
To touch the substance of life and realize
how connected we are to it.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:27.979
Whether it is by continuously progressing
in something little by little, or by stepping

00:01:27.979 --> 00:01:35.700
into an entirely new realm of possibility,
it is the associated wonder we feel that connects

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.900
us to life.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:44.820
Anytime we achieve a new career goal, or learn
a new skill, or discover a new concept of

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.280
life.

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:50.170
Or even just by new exposure to the senses.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:56.800
Like the first time we hear a song that brings
us to a harmonizing state of emotion that

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.729
we have never felt before.

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:07.640
Or the first time we see an animal in person
whose massive size is so unfathomable that

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:13.010
we feel as though we have been transported
to a different planet.

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:19.800
Or the first time we smell the lushness of
a tropical forest and it absorbs us into a

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.579
state of bliss.

00:02:22.579 --> 00:02:28.810
These feelings of wonder, however big or small
they may be, are the essence of human life.

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:30.329
They are the fuel to our engines.

00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:36.680
More than any pursuit of happiness or wealth
or fame, it is the pursuit of wonder that

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:38.200
truly brings us

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.000
to life.

